<title>BRAZIL: FORECAST-Individual survey of Brazilian indicators.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Individual survey of Brazilian indicators.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are individual economic forecasts collected by Reuters from the offices of eight brokerages and research firms in Sao Paulo and Rio de Janeiro. The survey is updated twice monthly.</p>
<p>*****Brazil Individual Economic Forecasts*****</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Period	     April	    April		 April</p>
<p>Indicator	CPI (Fipe)  PPI (IPA-M/FGV)   Infltn(IGP-M/FGV)</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
